{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220730","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220730","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"narration:0:1322073001:0":{"text":"雪米拉呼唤了许久，依旧没有听到戴蒙的回答。在不安之下，雪米拉查看了他们的“住所”，却发现戴蒙不见了！","source_cn":"雪米拉呼唤了许久，依旧没有听到戴蒙的回答。在不安之下，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD606109687681E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322073002:1":{"text":"戴蒙？戴蒙人呢？！","source_cn":"戴蒙？戴蒙人呢？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x342826E29AFFA4EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322073003:1":{"text":"什么？！","source_cn":"什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF91BABFDB2554AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322073004:1":{"text":"戴蒙他，他不见了！怎么会不见了……我们这么多人在这里……","source_cn":"戴蒙他，他不见了！怎么会不见了……我们这么多人在这里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCF4F8337655F093","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322073005:1":{"text":"是谁……是谁带走了他吗？！","source_cn":"是谁……是谁带走了他吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55894851F1E2465D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322073006: